{"v":"v45","content":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 33px;\"></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 39px;\"></span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 26px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 33px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 39px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Hoe Ouer Ek Word</span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><u><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 255, 0);\"><span style=\"\">Summary</span></span></u></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-family: Bitter;\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 255, 0);\"><span><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Die liedjie handel oor die proses van ouer word en die dieper perspektief wat daarmee saamkom. </span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Dit beskryf 'n verskuiwing vanaf uiterlike trots na innerlike sagtheid en deernis. </span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Die lirieke fokus op die aanvaarding van foute en die fisiese tekens van veroudering, </span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">soos rimpels en grys hare, wat nie as negatief gesien word nie, maar as simbole van stories en ervarings.</span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Daar is 'n sterk tema van teenwoordigheid en die besef dat tyd kosbaar is. </div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Die sanger kies om minder tyd te mors op onbelangrike dinge en meer liefde </span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">te gee aan die mense en oomblikke van vandag. </span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Dit is 'n lied van hoop en krag wat beklemtoon dat, al word die liggaam ouer, </span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">die innerlike gees en passie vir die lewe net harder brand. </span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Dit moedig die luisteraar aan om voluit te lewe en vrees te laat vaar.</span></span></span></div></span></span><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></div></span></span><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></div></span><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></div></span></span></span></span><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 39px;\"></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 30px;\"><u>Lyrics</u></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 30px;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 26px;\"><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Hoe ouer ek word, hoe sagter raak my trots</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Ek tel my foute soos klippe langs die plot</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Ek word meer bewus van elke asem in my bors</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Dis asof elke tree my nader vat aan my bron</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Ek sien rimpels langs my oë, maar my blik raak net meer skerp</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Ja, die dae word korter, maar my hart klop net meer sterk</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Hoe ouer ek word, hoe harder brand my lig</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Minder tyd om te mors, meer liefde om te gee</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Elke dag is 'n skat wat ek stywer in my hart vasklem</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Hoe ouer ek word, hoe meer leef ek in vandag</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Net vandag nog 'n grys haar, nog 'n storie om te vertel</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Van dae wat my breek en dae wat my weer heel</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Meer kreukels op my vel, maar minder vrees in my stem</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Ek leer om sag te praat met die mens binne-in my vel</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Ek sien name op die klippe, mense wat nie meer hier is</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Hulle fluister deur die stilte: Vat jou kans, los die vrees</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Hoe ouer ek word, hoe harder brand my lig</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Minder tyd om te mors, hoe meer liefde om te gee</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Vandag, elke dag, is 'n skat wat ek stywer in my hart vasgryp</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Hoe ouer ek word, hoe meer leef ek in vandag</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Net vandag, tyd glip deur my vingers soos water by die dam</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Maar ek dans nou in die reën, ek hardloop nie meer weg nie</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Elke sekonde skryf ek grof oor my hart</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">As die son weer sak môre, wil ek weet ek was deel van my dag</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Hoe ouer ek word, hoe harder brand my lig</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Minder tyd om te mors, meer liefde om te gee</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Vandag, elke dag, is 'n skat wat ek stywer in my hart vasgryp</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Hoe ouer ek word, hoe meer leef ek in vandag</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Net vandag, hoe ouer ek word, hoe wyer word my wêreld ook</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">As my asem eendag breek, wil ek weet ek het voluit geloop</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Elke merk op my vel is 'n lied wat ek nog gelyk skryf</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\">Hoe ouer ek word, hoe meer voel ek elke oomblik is my tyd, my tyd</span></div></span><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"></span></div></span></span><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 30px;\"></span></div>"}